  "description": "Overview We are pleased to announce that Sharda University is organizing the SUSTAIN-A-THON 2.0 2026 , a prestigious event designed to nurture innovation, creativity, and problem-solving among students from across the country. This event will serve as a platform for young minds to present impactful ideas and compete with peers at a national level. Event Structure: Stage 1 – Idea Submission : Open to all interested students upto 1st - 7th October , 2026 Stage 2 – Online Evaluation: Shortlisted teams will be evaluated by experts on 8th - 10th October, 2026 Stage 3 – Grand Finale: Finalist teams will compete in person at the (Experiential Learning Center, Block 45, Sharda University, Greater Noida) on 27th - 28th October 2026 .",
